AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IAO_0000121 "Term created to ease viewing/sort terms for development purpose, and will not be included in a release"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IAO_0000121 "term created to ease viewing/sort terms for development purpose, and will not be included in a release"@en)
