AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:IAO_0000124 "Nothing done yet beyond assigning a unique class ID and proposing a preferred term."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:IAO_0000124 "uncurated"@en)
